{"schema": 1, "entries": [{"path": "services/bridged/scripts/lib/bridge_core.mix", "line": "if \$etc == \"\" then \$etc = \"/etc/mixos\" end", "reason": "Main honours BRIDGED_CONFIG and MIXOS_ETC, then a fixed system fallback; using the tier resolver would newly honour MIXOS and layout.mx."}, {"path": "share/scenes/sync.mix", "line": "\$env_path = \"/etc/mixos/session/4.env\"", "reason": "Main defaults to this exact session environment file unless --env selects another; it does not consult MIXOS_ETC or MIXOS."}, {"path": "share/scenes/topbar/behaviour.mix", "line": "for \$line in read_lines(env(\"DESK_IDENTITY\", \"/etc/mixos/desk.env\"))", "reason": "Main honours DESK_IDENTITY, then this fixed system identity file; generic etc overrides did not select it."}, {"path": "services/indexd/examples/config.conf.mix", "line": "vectors_db: \"/var/lib/mixos/indexd/vectors.db\",", "reason": "The shipped example is consumed as literal path strings; indexd does not resolve logical references, and changing var tier would move the database/model paths."}, {"path": "services/indexd/examples/config.conf.mix", "line": "model_dir: \"/var/lib/mixos/indexd/model\",", "reason": "The shipped example is consumed as literal path strings; indexd does not resolve logical references, and changing var tier would move the database/model paths."}]}
